        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay earned bachelor’s and master’s degrees in electrical engineering and computer science from the University of California, Berkeley and is a graduate of the Stanford Graduate School of Business Executive Program (SEP).",
