        "id": "s5",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000072312526000023/mu-20260903.htm",
        "title": "Micron Technology, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information About Our Executive Officers, as of October 9, 2026)",
        "published_at": "2026-10-09",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay Mehrotra Chairman and Chief Executive Officer",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000072312526000023/mu-20260903.htm",
        "title": "Micron Technology, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information About Our Executive Officers, as of October 9, 2026)",
        "published_at": "2026-10-09",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Mehrotra, 68, joined us in May 2017 as our President, Chief Executive Officer, and Director. Mr. Mehrotra has served as Chairman of our Board of Directors since January 2025.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000072312526000023/mu-20260903.htm",
        "title": "Micron Technology, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information About Our Executive Officers, as of October 9, 2026)",
        "published_at": "2026-10-09",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Mehrotra co-founded and led SanDisk Corporation as a start-up in 1988 until its eventual sale in May 2016, serving as its President and Chief Executive Officer from January 2011 to May 2016, and as a member of its Board of Directors from July 2010 to May 2016.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s8",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000072312526000023/mu-20260903.htm",
        "title": "Micron Technology, Inc. Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2026 (Information About Our Executive Officers, as of October 9, 2026)",
        "published_at": "2026-10-09",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Mehrotra served as a member of the Board of Directors for Cavium, Inc. from July 2009 until July 2018, for Western Digital Corp. from May 2016 to February 2017, and for CDW Corporation from March 2021 to May 2026.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s9",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000110465926101067/tm2624017d1_ex99-1.htm",
        "title": "Micron Announces Leadership Appointments to Accelerate Innovation and Growth (Press Release, Exhibit 99.1 to Form 8-K)",
        "published_at": "2026-08-26",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Effective immediately, Manish Bhatia has been appointed to president and chief operating officer, and Dr. Scott DeBoer has been appointed to president and chief technology and products officer.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s10",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000110465926101067/tm2624017d1_ex99-1.htm",
        "title": "Micron Announces Leadership Appointments to Accelerate Innovation and Growth (Press Release, Exhibit 99.1 to Form 8-K)",
        "published_at": "2026-08-26",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "said Sanjay Mehrotra, chairman and chief executive officer of Micron Technology.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s11",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000072312525000038/mu-20251125.htm",
        "title": "Micron Technology, Inc. 2025 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)",
        "published_at": "2025-11-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Our Board is currently led by Sanjay Mehrotra, as our Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer, and Lynn A. Dugle, as our Lead Independent Director.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s12",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/723125/000072312525000038/mu-20251125.htm",
        "title": "Micron Technology, Inc. 2025 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)",
        "published_at": "2025-11-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay Mehrotra Chairman, Chief Executive Officer Age | 67 Director Since | 2017",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s13",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1000180/000095013408003259/f38194e10vk.htm",
        "title": "SanDisk Corporation Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2007 (Executive Officers)",
        "published_at": "2008-02-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay Mehrotra co-founded SanDisk in 1988 and has been our President since June 2006. He continues to serve as our Chief Operating Officer, a position he has held since 2001, and he has previously served as our Executive Vice President, Vice President of Engineering, Vice President of Product Development, and Director of Memory Design and Product Engineering.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s14",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1000180/000095013408003259/f38194e10vk.htm",
        "title": "SanDisk Corporation Annual Report on Form 10-K for fiscal 2007 (Executive Officers; all ages are as of February 15, 2008)",
        "published_at": "2008-02-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay Mehrotra 49 President and Chief Operating Officer",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s15",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1000180/000119312511107766/ddef14a.htm",
        "title": "SanDisk Corporation 2011 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)",
        "published_at": "2011-04-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Mehrotra co-founded the Company in 1988 and became President and Chief Executive Officer effective January 2011. He was appointed to the Company’s Board in July 2010.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s16",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1000180/000119312511107766/ddef14a.htm",
        "title": "SanDisk Corporation 2011 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)",
        "published_at": "2011-04-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Mehrotra has previously served in various executive roles for the Company, including as the Company’s President and Chief Operating Officer, Executive Vice President and Chief Operating Officer, Senior Vice President of Product Development, Vice President of Product Development, and Director of Design Engineering.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s17",
        "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1000180/000119312511107766/ddef14a.htm",
        "title": "SanDisk Corporation 2011 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)",
        "published_at": "2011-04-25",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. Mehrotra has more than 30 years of experience in the non-volatile semiconductor memory industry including engineering and management positions at the Company, Integrated Device Technology, Inc., SEEQ Technology, Inc., Intel Corporation and Atmel Corporation.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s18",
        "url": "https://engineering.berkeley.edu/news/2017/11/alumni-notes-12/",
        "title": "Alumni notes - Berkeley Engineering",
        "published_at": "2017-11",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay Mehrotra (B.S.’78, M.S.’80 EECS) is Micron’s new president and CEO.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s19",
        "url": "https://eecs.berkeley.edu/news/sanjay-mehrotra-microns-new-president-and-ceo/",
        "title": "Sanjay Mehrotra is Micron's new President and CEO - EECS at Berkeley",
        "published_at": "2017-05-02",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Alumnus Sanjay Mehrotra (EECS B.S. ’78/M.S. ’80) has been named Micron’s new President and CEO.",
        "tier": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "s20",
        "url": "https://www.computerhistory.org/collections/catalog/102740455",
        "title": "Mehrotra, Sanjay oral history - 102740455 - CHM (Computer History Museum catalog)",
        "published_at": "2019-02-15",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sanjay Mehrotra, born in Kanpur, India, is president and chief executive officer at Micron Technology.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s21",
        "url": "https://www.computerhistory.org/collections/catalog/102740455",
        "title": "Mehrotra, Sanjay oral history - 102740455 - CHM (Computer History Museum catalog)",
        "published_at": "2019-02-15",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Prior to SanDisk, Mr. Mehrotra held design engineering positions at Integrated Device Technology, Inc., SEEQ Technology and Intel Corporation.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s22",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "I was born in Kanpur, India in 1958.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s23",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Sure so, it was the summer of 1976 at the end of my finishing second year of college at BITS Pilani.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s24",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Yes, so my first job that I started after leaving UC Berkeley graduate school was working in non-volatile memory.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s25",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "So I joined Intel Corporation in 1980, January, and I moved–actually, for six months I went to a company called ZyMOS.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s26",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "So I followed George to Seeq Technology and that was in 1982. And I was there until 1986.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s27",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "I was European Applications Manager in U.K.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s28",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "So after Seeq, where I had done five-volt only E2PROMs, I actually went to Integrated Device Technology as the Design Engineering Manager",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s29",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "And this I’m talking about now 1986, 1987 timeframe at Integrated Device Technology.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s30",
        "url": "https://s3.us-west-1.wasabisys.com/chm-cms-media/media-live/_file/import/102740455-05-01-acc.pdf",
        "title": "Oral History of Sanjay Mehrotra (Computer History Museum, recorded February 14, 2019; transcript PDF)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "I felt guilty and I decided not to join Atmel at that time.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s31",
        "url": "https://www.forbes.com/profile/sanjay-mehrotra/",
        "title": "Sanjay Mehrotra (Forbes profile)",
        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mehrotra was born in Kanpur, India, and immigrated to the United States at age 18 to study electrical engineering and computer science at the University of California, Berkeley.",
        "tier": 2
      },
